# macOS-specific configure options.
#
# Homebrew keg paths for lz4/zstd on Apple Silicon build hosts. These are
# build-time search paths only: runtime linkage is rewritten to
# @loader_path/../lib and verified to contain no Homebrew references
# (scripts/rewrite-runtime-links-darwin.sh, verify-runtime-links-darwin.sh).
# For a darwin-amd64 build host, /usr/local is Homebrew's prefix instead.
--with-libraries=/opt/homebrew/lib
--with-includes=/opt/homebrew/include
